  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFplV8U.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"1000\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/852146?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcGPE3mktFe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1141743994154528768?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&label=MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure&color=FF0000&link=https://discord.com/invite/cGPE3mktFe\" alt=\"\" width=\"430\" height=\"29\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>我的專案</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minecolonies-dimensional-adventure-re-blueprinted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies：維度冒險 [重新藍圖化] 點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/979514?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Cloche Creations&color=FF0000&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloche-creations\" alt=\"\" width=\"223\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mbekts9X?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Cloche Creations&color=FF0000&link=https://modrinth.com/mod/cloche-creations\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1098989?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=MineColonies: Block Party&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/wdfIaSqz?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=MineColonies: Block Party&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/985671?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Grass&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftinted-grass%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ZwO3amOU?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Grass&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/994223?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Torches&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mc1hqaaO?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Torches&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1009078?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Dyes&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/77VVvOOe?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Dyes&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1037808?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Sands&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/d72EAPUQ?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Sands&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1164785?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Planks&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rDPwULcT?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Planks&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>*免責聲明*</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>本整合包目前處於&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>積極開發階段</em></strong></span>。雖然遊戲內容完整可玩，但在開發過程中仍可能會遇到各種錯誤與設定變更，因為我不斷調整以符合我的構想。（對於可能造成的誤解深感抱歉！！！）</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>本整合包與 MineColonies 官方開發團隊或其任何官方整合包均無正式關聯。</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>請絕對不要向他們尋求關於本整合包的故障排除協助！！！！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>就這些了！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>此外，使用 Tlauncher 的玩家將獲得本人及開發團隊的「零支援」。請購買正版遊戲！！！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>ATLauncher 與 GDLauncher 在本整合包上會出現異常，建議改用 Curseforge 或 Prism！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>出於安全考量，請僅從 Curseforge 下載本整合包。</p>\n<p>本計畫僅發布於 Curseforge。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/igt8rYA.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;踏上創造與探索的世界吧！MineColonies：維度冒險將你的 Minecraft 體驗從單純的建造提升至敘事創作、社群發展，以及開拓屬於你自己的獨特旅程。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;作為你領地的建築師，讓你的殖民地一塊磚一塊磚地甦醒。讓你的城鎮充滿活力，每個角落都洋溢著你注入的生命氣息。但別太安於現狀！在城鎮舒適的巷弄之外，還有未探明的維度、詭譎的地牢與遙遠的星球，等待著勇敢的探險家揭開它們的奧秘。MineColonies：維度冒險不僅限於單人遊玩。你可以與朋友或整個社群攜手合作，共享創造與探索的樂趣。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1GTzwbv.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p><br><strong>動態 NPC</strong>：體驗一個生機勃勃的城鎮，擁有建築師、工匠、農民、漁夫、衛兵、礦工、熔爐工、麵包師、廚師、送貨員、畜牧夫等豐富的 NPC 角色！<br><strong>專屬建築</strong>：建造倉庫、公民小屋與市政廳等基礎設施，打造獨一無二的殖民地。<br><strong>多元維度</strong>：展開跨越多個維度的旅程，每個維度都提供獨特的冒險與資源。<br><strong>各類地牢</strong>：探索充滿隱藏寶藏與強大敵人的各式挑戰性地牢。<br><strong>豐富建材</strong>：擁有龐大的建材選擇，助你築起夢想中的基地。<br><strong>安防設備</strong>：利用先進的安防裝置保護辛苦建立的基地免受怪物侵擾。<br><strong>科技大作戰</strong>：深入先進科技世界，整合 Mekanism、Immersive Engineering 與 Applied Energistics 等模組。<br><strong>飛艇與太空探索</strong>：駕駛優雅的飛艇翱翔天際，或踏足宇宙探索並征服新星球。<br><strong>多樣農作物</strong>：種植豐富的作物來餵養公民，維持殖民地持續發展。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QzeIzFU.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p><br style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;我們對於 MineColonies：維度冒險的願景，是為所有人打造一款友善且有趣的整合包。我們相信選擇的力量與創造的樂趣。我們的目標是提供一個環境，讓你能夠構建複雜的機械、建立自己的城鎮、展開宏大冒險，並譜寫屬於自己的故事。冒險的模樣由你定義，唯一的限制就是你的想像力。歡迎踏上屬於你的維度冒險！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aMuYvNz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><del>E4MC 已預先安裝於本整合包中，讓玩家無需任何設定即可輕鬆加入好友的單人世界。只需啟動整合包、邀請好友，即可開始共同建構屬於你們的維度冒險。</del></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我們目前正在尋找該功能的更佳解決方案。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>（雖遲但到）非常感谢大家一直陪伴我與這個整合包，並幫助我們突破 120 萬次下載。我真的受寵若驚。我從未想過能走到今天這一步。你們真的太棒了！！！！！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>官方 Discord：<strong>請點擊&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>問題回報分頁</strong></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>伺服器整合包：<strong>正式釋出</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.21：<strong>積極開發中</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>1.12.2 以下版本將不再推出支援。抱歉。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>所有模組的歸功皆屬於其各自的原作者。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>遇到特定模組的問題時，請務必優先向對應原作者回報。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>問題回饋與意見可發佈至 Discord。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
